# football-trackers MQTT ACL.
#
# The server's read-only ingest account sees all telemetry + status.
user ingest
topic read football-trackers/#

# Every wearable authenticates with username == its PLAYER_ID (e.g. "01") and may publish
# ONLY to its own player's telemetry/status topics. %u expands to the username, so device
# "01" can write .../player/01/... and nothing else — it cannot forge another player's data.
# (The server also rejects body/topic id mismatches as `dropped{reason="id_mismatch"}`.)
pattern write football-trackers/session/+/player/%u/telemetry
pattern write football-trackers/session/+/player/%u/status
